## Paying with your card''s coverage

When your damage coverage is your credit card''s, the pay page says "Pay with the card that covers this rental" and names its network (for example Visa). A card of a different network is stopped before it is charged, and if one gets through the payment is refused with a plain message and nothing is charged. Pay with the covering card, or change how the car is covered.
